#problem12 Vehicle and Car (Single Inheritance)

Code:

class Vehicle:
    def start(self):
        print("Vehicle is starting")

class Car(Vehicle):
    def drive(self):
        print("Car is driving")

c = Car()

c.start()
c.drive()

Output

Vehicle is starting
Car is driving

Concept used:
✔ Inheritance (Car inherits Vehicle)

#problem2 Shape, Circle, Rectangle (Polymorphism / Method Overriding)

Code:

class Shape:
    def area(self):
        print("Area calculation")

class Circle(Shape):
    def area(self):
        r = int(input("Enter radius: "))
        print("Area of circle:", 3.14 * r * r)

class Rectangle(Shape):
    def area(self):
        l = int(input("Enter length: "))
        b = int(input("Enter breadth: "))
        print("Area of rectangle:", l * b)

c = Circle()
c.area()

r = Rectangle()
r.area()

